# The terminal this module configures.
#
# Here rather than in modules/apps despite being a GUI app with a window: apps
# is the grab-bag for casks with no config of their own, and this one has a
# module. Enabling `cmux` must not link a cmux.json that nothing reads.
#
# No ghostty cask -- cmux embeds libghostty and reads home/.config/ghostty/
# config itself. The Nerd Font that file names stays in modules/apps for the
# reason given there: no single module owns it.

cask "cmux"
